msgctxt "scroll 057A:00DE"
msgid "~Shopping list~~Torax ribs~Kith filet~Cheese~Fish~Blue Mushrooms~Butter~Salt"
msgstr "~購物清單~~托拉克斯肋排~奇斯怪蛛肉排~乳酪~魚~藍蘑菇~奶油~鹽"

# P13 batch 8
msgctxt "scroll 057A:026C"
msgid "I can go no further. These blasted magical walls have taken my strength, and I am afraid, my life. ~Too late have I discovered a way to detect the walls without cost to myself.~These humble mushrooms that litter the floor awake the wall's power when tossed at them! ~Alas, I can only eat these mushrooms. Perhaps they may bring me strength to escape this cavern..."
msgstr "我走不動了。這些該死的魔法牆耗盡了我的力氣，恐怕連我的命也要賠上。~我發現得太晚了，原來有辦法不必付出代價就能察覺這些牆。~散落在地上的這些不起眼的蘑菇，只要朝牆扔過去，就會喚醒牆的力量！~唉，我現在只能吃這些蘑菇了。也許它們能給我力氣，讓我逃出這個洞穴……"

# P13 batch 8
msgctxt "scroll 057A:0401"
msgid "I lie here awaiting the end. I know now that I will never see Lithos, curse these frail bones of mine. My strength is not great enough to withstand these tests. My only hope is that my twin brother will make it though without me. My hopes and spirit rest with him... ~Should anyone find this note, please tell him of my passing. ~          Thank you,~            Bryan"
msgstr "我躺在這裡等待終結。我現在知道，我永遠見不到利索斯了，都怪我這副孱弱的骨頭。我的力氣不足以熬過這些考驗。我唯一的希望，是我的雙胞胎兄弟能在沒有我的情況下撐過去。我的希望與精神都寄託在他身上……~若有人發現這張紙條，請告訴他我已離世。~謝謝你，~布萊恩"

# P13 batch 8
msgctxt "scroll 057A:058A"
msgid "I lie here awaiting the end. I know now that I will never see Lithos, curse these frail bones of mine. My strength is not great enough to withstand these tests. My only hope is that my twin brother will make it though without me. My hopes and spirit rest with him... ~Should anyone find this note, please tell him of my passing. ~          Thank you,~Bruce"
